'''Merced''' ({{Langx|djv|Mercedesa}}; {{Langx|arn|Penko|4=seeing the water}}; [[Baliscano]] and [[W:Judeo-Catalan|Judeo-Volisan]] for "mercy") is the historic capital of the [[Communities of Balisca|community]] of [[Cerdanya]] and the [[List of cities in Balisca by population|10th most populous]] city in [[Balisca]], with a population of 1,120,647 in the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]]. Merced together with neighboring [[Concepción]] forms ''[[Mercepción]]'', an urban agglomeration in [[Gran País del Sur|Northern Cerdanya]] along the southern shore of the [[Sea of Shuainia]]. 

